WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.439
<i>[ukulele music]</i>
<i>[尤克里里音乐]</i>

00:02.508 --> 00:09.508
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

00:11.404 --> 00:14.887
[background chattering]
[背景窃窃私语]

00:14.956 --> 00:16.611
Order for...
订购...

00:16.680 --> 00:18.715
Huh?
啊？

00:18.784 --> 00:22.922
both: Om, nom, nom.
两者：唵，名义，名义。

00:22.991 --> 00:23.991
Ohh.
哦。

00:24.059 --> 00:25.577
Disgusting!
恶心！

00:25.646 --> 00:28.887
You people eat like anima...
anima...
你们这些人吃得像阿尼玛……
阿尼玛...

00:28.956 --> 00:31.611
Anima...
Achoo!
阿尼玛...
阿呼！

00:31.680 --> 00:34.749
<i>[sad music]</i>
<i>[悲伤的音乐]</i>

00:34.818 --> 00:35.818
[barking]
[叫声]

00:35.887 --> 00:37.266
Oh, there's my baby.
哦，我的宝贝在那儿。

00:37.335 --> 00:42.853
Oh, my little baby!
哦，我的小宝贝！

00:42.922 --> 00:44.404
Oh, no.
哦，不。

00:44.473 --> 00:47.508
You cannot bring a worm in here.
你不能把虫子带进来。

00:47.577 --> 00:49.266
It's unclean!
不干净啊！

00:49.335 --> 00:51.991
And some of us are allergi...
我们中的一些人过敏...

00:52.059 --> 00:55.473
Achoo! Bah!...gic.
阿呼！呸！……太棒了。

00:55.542 --> 00:58.887
What's with all the sniffy
fits out here, Mr. Squidward?
所有的嗅觉是怎么回事
章鱼哥先生，这里适合吗？

00:58.956 --> 01:01.197
It's not my fault,
Mr. Krabs.
这不是我的错
蟹老板。

01:01.266 --> 01:04.301
She snuck a pet
into the restaurant.
她偷偷养了一只宠物
进入餐厅。

01:04.370 --> 01:10.059
Oh, I didn't know my sweet
little Fifi wasn't allowed.
哦，我不知道我的甜蜜
小菲菲不被允许。

01:10.128 --> 01:12.956
Aaaachoo!
啊啊啊！

01:13.025 --> 01:14.784
Hmm?
唔？

01:14.853 --> 01:16.680
[poof]
[panting]
[噗]
[气喘吁吁]

01:16.749 --> 01:19.922
Well, your sweet little
Foofoo's gotta go.
嗯，你可爱的小
福福该走了。

01:19.991 --> 01:21.749
We have a strict policy.
我们有严格的政策。

01:21.818 --> 01:23.301
No pets allowed.
不允许携带宠物。

01:23.370 --> 01:25.232
What a shame.
真丢脸。

01:25.301 --> 01:28.611
Krabby Patties are all my Fifi
will eat these days.
蟹黄饼都是我的菲菲
这几天会吃。

01:28.680 --> 01:31.680
Oh, I would have gladly paid
double the price
哦，我很乐意付钱
双倍价格

01:31.749 --> 01:34.956
if it only meant she could have
her favorite food.
如果这仅仅意味着她可以
她最喜欢的食物。

01:35.025 --> 01:36.611
[squeals]
[尖叫声]

01:36.680 --> 01:38.404
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

01:38.473 --> 01:40.439
Ah, there!
All fixed.
啊，在那里！
全部固定。

01:40.508 --> 01:43.439
See?
"Now: Pets Allowed!"
看？
“现在：允许携带宠物！”

01:43.508 --> 01:46.197
Oh!
How delightful!
哦！
多么令人愉快啊！

01:46.266 --> 01:47.922
Of course.
当然。

01:47.991 --> 01:50.335
Bwaa choo!
呸呸呸！

01:50.404 --> 01:53.473
[overlapping chatter]
[重叠的喋喋不休]

01:55.094 --> 01:56.508
[cow moos]
[牛哞哞]

01:56.577 --> 01:57.784
Hee hee!
嘻嘻！

01:57.853 --> 01:59.922
I tell ya, Mr. Squidward,
我告诉你，章鱼哥先生，

01:59.991 --> 02:02.646
I'm makin' more money
than Neptune!
我要赚更多的钱
比海王星！

02:02.715 --> 02:03.715
Hehehe!
呵呵呵呵！

02:03.749 --> 02:06.059
Aachoo!
Bah!
啊呼！
呸!

02:07.197 --> 02:08.922
Hmm?
唔？

02:08.991 --> 02:11.163
Hold it right there, Krabs.
抓住它，蟹蟹。

02:11.232 --> 02:13.266
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

02:14.853 --> 02:16.715
Oh, no!
The health inspector!
哦，不！
卫生督察！

02:16.784 --> 02:19.749
Oh, yes.
The health inspector.
哦是的。
卫生督察。

02:19.818 --> 02:22.818
And I'm afraid you can't
run a restaurant
恐怕你不能
经营一家餐馆

02:22.887 --> 02:26.128
and a feed lot
out of the same building!
和一个饲料场
从同一栋楼出来的！

02:26.197 --> 02:28.370
Hee, hee.
Ha, ha!
嘿嘿。
哈，哈！

02:28.439 --> 02:30.370
It's unsanitary.
这是不卫生的。

02:30.439 --> 02:33.197
I'm shutting you down!
我要关掉你了！

02:33.266 --> 02:36.335
Unless you pick one.
除非你选一个。

02:36.404 --> 02:38.922
People or pets.
人或宠物。

02:38.991 --> 02:41.301
Ohh.
Heh.
哦。
呵呵。

02:41.370 --> 02:43.197
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

02:43.266 --> 02:44.956
Ooh!
哦！

02:45.025 --> 02:46.128
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

02:46.197 --> 02:48.611
Ooh!
哦！

02:48.680 --> 02:50.818
Oh, yeah!
哦，是啊！

02:50.887 --> 02:52.956
I choose pets!
我选择宠物！

02:53.025 --> 02:54.335
Heh, ha!
呵呵！

02:54.404 --> 02:56.094
What?!
No!
什么？！
不！

02:56.163 --> 02:57.680
All right, you heard the man.
好吧，你听到了那个人的话。

02:57.749 --> 02:59.508
If you ain't a pet,
you're trespassing.
如果你不是宠物
你这是非法侵入。

02:59.577 --> 03:01.508
Time to go!
Get a move on.
是时候出发了！
继续前进。

03:01.577 --> 03:04.956
Wait a minute.
What about our pets?
等一下。
我们的宠物呢？

03:05.025 --> 03:06.784
Oh!
Well, don't worry.
哦！
好吧，别担心。

03:06.853 --> 03:10.853
I'll still be billin' ya
for whatever they eat.
我仍然会向你收费
无论他们吃什么。

03:10.922 --> 03:13.232
all: Whoa!
全体：哇！

03:19.335 --> 03:21.197
[retches]
[干呕]

03:21.266 --> 03:22.439
both: Eww.
两人：呃。

03:22.508 --> 03:24.404
...Hoo, hoo!
- Sandy.
……呼呼！
- 桑迪。

03:24.473 --> 03:28.059
Your Alaskan Bull Worm
certainly was hungry.
你的阿拉斯加牛蠕虫
肯定是饿了。

03:28.128 --> 03:29.232
[gasp]
[喘气]

03:29.301 --> 03:32.577
Sweet jawbone of San Antone,
I'm broke!
圣安东的甜蜜颚骨，
我破产了！

03:32.646 --> 03:36.577
Looks like I'm eatin' canned
nuts for the rest of the year.
看来我在吃罐头
今年剩下的时间里都是坚果。

03:36.646 --> 03:38.611
Ah.
啊。

03:40.025 --> 03:41.887
[animals chatter]
[动物叽叽喳喳]

03:41.956 --> 03:44.853
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

03:44.922 --> 03:46.439
Welcome, little worm!
欢迎，小虫子！

03:46.508 --> 03:47.749
Here at the Krusty Krab,
在蟹堡王这里，

03:47.818 --> 03:49.991
it's a pet paradise.
- Aaah.
这是一个宠物天堂。
- 啊啊。

03:50.059 --> 03:54.853
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

03:54.922 --> 03:56.370
Enjoy yourself!
尽情享受吧！

03:56.439 --> 03:58.001
And don't forget to order
something to eat.
并且不要忘记订购
吃点东西。

03:58.025 --> 03:59.956
[barking]
[叫声]

04:01.508 --> 04:03.784
Oh uh, maybe I'll order for you.
噢，也许我可以为你订购。

04:03.853 --> 04:04.853
Heh, heh.
呵呵。

04:06.887 --> 04:08.266
Hey, man.
嘿，伙计。

04:08.335 --> 04:10.956
Could I like...
get a Krabby Patty to go?
我可以喜欢...
去吃蟹肉饼吗？

04:11.025 --> 04:13.577
Sorry.
Pets only.
对不起。
仅限宠物。

04:13.646 --> 04:16.335
You can try your luck across
the street.
你可以试试你的运气
街道。

04:16.404 --> 04:18.956
Aww.
I don't wanna eat chum.
哇。
我不想吃密友。

04:21.025 --> 04:23.956
[laughing]
[笑]

04:24.025 --> 04:25.991
- Rawr!
- [groans]
- 劳尔！
- [呻吟]

04:26.059 --> 04:28.301
[disappointed groaning]
[失望的呻吟]

04:28.370 --> 04:30.922
Heh, heh!
The house special!
呵呵！
房子特别！

04:30.991 --> 04:32.439
Ugh.
啊。

04:32.508 --> 04:35.301
It's great that my pets
are eating and all, but...
我的宠物真是太好了
正在吃东西，但是……

04:35.370 --> 04:37.611
I'm still hungry!
我还饿着呢！

04:37.680 --> 04:38.922
Aww.
哇。

04:38.991 --> 04:41.680
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

04:41.749 --> 04:42.956
Heh, heh.
呵呵。

04:43.025 --> 04:44.301
<i>[twinkling music]</i>
<i>[闪烁的音乐]</i>

04:44.370 --> 04:45.301
[gulp]
[吞咽]

04:45.370 --> 04:47.473
Mmm.
嗯。

04:47.542 --> 04:49.715
I wish I was a pet
我希望我是一只宠物

04:49.784 --> 04:52.128
so I could eat off the floor.
这样我就可以在地板上吃饭了。

04:52.197 --> 04:54.680
You are eating off the floor.
你正在地板上吃东西。

04:54.749 --> 04:56.335
Yeah, but...
是的，但是...

04:56.404 --> 04:59.025
I wanna eat Krabby Patties
off the floor!
我想吃蟹黄饼
离开地板！

04:59.094 --> 05:01.956
The pink dude might have
the right idea, guys.
粉红色的家伙可能有
正确的想法，伙计们。

05:02.025 --> 05:03.818
If we dress up like pets...
如果我们打扮得像宠物一样……

05:03.887 --> 05:06.956
We could trick Krabs
into serving us!
我们可以欺骗蟹蟹
为我们服务！

05:07.025 --> 05:08.439
Of course!
当然！

05:08.508 --> 05:11.922
If you wanna make costumes,
I have a craft corner.
如果你想制作服装，
我有一个手工角。

05:11.991 --> 05:13.266
Oh, boy!
哦，孩子！

05:13.335 --> 05:14.508
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

05:14.577 --> 05:16.163
Aaah, plah!
啊啊，普拉！

05:16.232 --> 05:18.577
Oh, construction paper.
Oh, boy!
噢，建筑用纸。
哦，孩子！

05:18.646 --> 05:21.059
[overlapping chatter]
[重叠的喋喋不休]

05:21.128 --> 05:23.094
Anyone seen the glue?
有人见过胶水吗？

05:23.163 --> 05:24.508
[chuckling menacingly]
[威胁地笑]

05:24.577 --> 05:27.232
Now's my chance to sneak
into the Krusty Krab
现在是我潜行的机会
进入蟹堡王

05:27.301 --> 05:28.887
in my pet, Spot.
在我的宠物 Spot 中。

05:28.956 --> 05:29.887
[barking]
[叫声]

05:29.956 --> 05:31.611
[chuckling]
[轻笑]

05:31.680 --> 05:33.439
Hey...
What's happening?
嘿...
发生什么事了？

05:33.508 --> 05:36.128
No, Spot.
Stop digesting me, Spot!
不，斑点。
别再消化我了，现货！

05:36.197 --> 05:37.646
Bad Spot!
坏点！

05:37.715 --> 05:39.404
Yeeoowww!
是啊www！

05:42.473 --> 05:44.059
[barking]
[叫声]

05:44.128 --> 05:45.611
Barnacles.
藤壶。

05:45.680 --> 05:48.301
<i>[accordion music]</i>
<i>[手风琴音乐]</i>

05:48.370 --> 05:51.473
Into the wall ya go!
进墙吧！

05:51.542 --> 05:53.749
[gasps]
What the...?
[喘气]
什么……？

05:53.818 --> 05:56.646
Oh, boy!
I mean... aarf, aarf.
哦，孩子！
我的意思是……阿夫，阿夫。

05:56.715 --> 05:57.715
Hmm...
唔...

05:57.749 --> 05:58.922
Hungry!
饥饿的！

05:58.991 --> 06:00.128
Hmm...
唔...

06:00.197 --> 06:01.818
Ooh, ha, ha.
Ha, ha.
哦，哈哈哈。
哈，哈。

06:01.887 --> 06:03.646
Woof, woof!
汪汪汪！

06:03.715 --> 06:05.853
Hmm.
Squidward!
唔。
章鱼哥！

06:05.922 --> 06:07.646
[grumbles]
[抱怨]

06:07.715 --> 06:09.749
Rawh!
哇！

06:10.784 --> 06:14.197
Yes, Mister... Achoo! Krabs.
是的，先生……阿丘！螃蟹。

06:14.266 --> 06:16.094
Why don't all these new pets
为什么所有这些新宠物都不

06:16.163 --> 06:17.680
have patties in front of 'em?
他们面前有肉饼吗？

06:17.749 --> 06:20.163
I'm running a business,
not a shelter!
我正在经营一家企业，
不是庇护所！

06:20.232 --> 06:22.508
Ow!
噢！

06:26.335 --> 06:27.439
- Mmm.
- Huh?
- 嗯。
- 啊？

06:27.508 --> 06:30.025
Greetings, fellow lagomorph.
哈喽，兔类同胞们。

06:30.094 --> 06:33.370
Perhaps you might consider
sharing a sliver of your...
也许你可以考虑
分享你的一小部分...

06:33.439 --> 06:35.128
[screaming]
[尖叫]

06:35.197 --> 06:36.577
[gasps]
[喘气]

06:36.646 --> 06:38.749
I'll just be...
我就只是...

06:38.818 --> 06:40.059
[grunts]
[咕哝]

06:40.128 --> 06:42.991
[rabbits snarling]
[兔子咆哮]

06:47.301 --> 06:48.197
[all gasp]
[全都喘气]

06:48.266 --> 06:49.404
Hahaha!
哈哈哈！

06:49.473 --> 06:51.439
[cheering]
[欢呼]

06:51.508 --> 06:53.577
[all growling]
[全都咆哮]

06:53.646 --> 06:56.404
[blows landing]
[吹着陆]

06:56.473 --> 06:58.163
Pet fight!
宠物大战！

06:58.232 --> 06:59.163
Rah!
啊！

06:59.232 --> 07:01.439
Aaaah!
啊啊啊！

07:01.508 --> 07:03.059
[whimpering]
[呜咽]

07:03.128 --> 07:05.094
[whimpering]
[呜咽]

07:05.163 --> 07:07.404
[growling and hissing]
[咆哮和嘶嘶声]

07:07.473 --> 07:08.853
Mrowr!
呜呜！

07:08.922 --> 07:10.784
My leg!
我的腿！

07:10.853 --> 07:12.818
[cawing]
[啼叫]

07:12.887 --> 07:14.059
No, no, no.
Bad scallops!
不，不，不。
扇贝坏了！

07:14.128 --> 07:15.266
Aaaah!
啊啊啊！

07:15.335 --> 07:16.542
[crashing]
[崩溃]

07:16.611 --> 07:19.439
[chaotic screaming]
[混乱的尖叫声]

07:19.508 --> 07:22.059
Who's ready for...
谁准备好...

07:22.128 --> 07:24.266
a violent brawl?
暴力斗殴？

07:24.335 --> 07:26.611
Stop, please!
请停一下！

07:26.680 --> 07:30.301
The Krusty Krab
is a place of peace.
蟹堡王
是一个和平的地方。

07:30.370 --> 07:32.128
[growling]
[咆哮]

07:32.197 --> 07:33.094
- Yow!
- Yow!
- 哟！
- 哟！

07:33.163 --> 07:35.059
[growling]
[咆哮]

07:35.128 --> 07:37.508
Dah!
呸！

07:37.577 --> 07:40.197
[gasps]
The health inspector?
[喘气]
卫生督察？

07:40.266 --> 07:42.956
all: The health inspector?
全体：卫生督察？

07:44.301 --> 07:45.887
Eh...
Roar?
呃……
咆哮？

07:45.956 --> 07:49.853
But I thought you said people
and pets can't eat together?
但我以为你说的是人
和宠物不能一起吃饭吗？

07:49.922 --> 07:52.818
Yeah.
What are you doing here?
是的。
你在这里做什么？

07:52.887 --> 07:55.301
This whole mess is your fault!
这一切的混乱都是你的错！

07:55.370 --> 07:58.094
[crowd clamoring]
[人群喧闹]

07:58.163 --> 08:01.404
Em, I was just hungry
for a Krabby Patty.
Em，我只是饿了
蟹肉饼。

08:01.473 --> 08:03.439
We've all been there, right?
我们都去过那里，对吧？

08:03.508 --> 08:06.542
Plus, I, um, I learned
something today!
另外，我，嗯，我学到了
今天有事！

08:06.611 --> 08:10.094
SpongeBob, give me
a bouncy C, would ya?
海绵宝宝，给我
一个有弹性的C，好吗？

08:10.163 --> 08:11.542
Ooo, gladly!
噢噢，很高兴！

08:11.611 --> 08:13.611
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

08:13.680 --> 08:15.853
[lively music]
[活泼的音乐]

08:15.922 --> 08:18.715
♪ Pets are people too ♪
♪ 宠物也是人 ♪

08:18.784 --> 08:21.922
♪ Just like me, just like you ♪
♪ 就像我一样，就像你一样 ♪

08:21.991 --> 08:24.991
♪ Yes, whatever
you like to do ♪
♪ 是的，无论如何
你喜欢做的事♪

08:25.059 --> 08:28.301
♪ There's a pet
who likes it too ♪
♪ 有一只宠物
谁也喜欢♪

08:28.370 --> 08:30.577
♪ There's a pet for people
who like to run ♪
♪ 人们有一只宠物
喜欢跑步的人♪

08:30.646 --> 08:32.094
♪ And one for people
who don't ♪
♪ 一款为人们服务的
谁不喜欢♪

08:32.163 --> 08:33.749
♪ A pet for folks
who avoid the sun ♪
♪ 适合人们的宠物
躲避阳光的人♪

08:33.818 --> 08:35.370
♪ And those who should
but won't ♪
♪ 以及那些应该
但不会♪

08:35.439 --> 08:37.301
♪ A pet for people
who sing and dance ♪
♪ 人类的宠物
又唱又跳的人♪

08:37.370 --> 08:38.784
♪ A pet for people who cry ♪
♪ 适合哭泣的人的宠物 ♪

08:38.853 --> 08:40.311
♪ A pet for people
who take a chance ♪
♪ 人类的宠物
谁抓住机会♪

08:40.335 --> 08:41.749
♪ And for those
with just one eye ♪
♪ 对于那些
只有一只眼睛♪

08:41.818 --> 08:43.266
♪ Yes, no matter what
we say or do ♪
♪ 是的，无论如何
我们说或做♪

08:43.335 --> 08:45.197
♪ There's just one thing
I know is true ♪
♪ 只有一件事
我知道这是真的♪

08:45.266 --> 08:46.991
♪ We all eat patties,
yes we do! ♪
♪ 我们都吃肉饼，
是的，我们愿意！ ♪

08:47.059 --> 08:49.232
♪ And every pet likes
eating them too! ♪
♪ 每只宠物都喜欢
也吃它们！ ♪

08:49.301 --> 08:50.439
♪ Because ♪
♪ 因为 ♪

08:50.508 --> 08:53.059
all:
♪ Pets are people too ♪
全部：
♪ 宠物也是人 ♪

08:53.128 --> 08:56.542
♪ Just like me, just like you ♪
♪ 就像我一样，就像你一样 ♪

08:56.611 --> 08:59.818
♪ Yes, whatever
you like to do ♪
♪ 是的，无论如何
你喜欢做的事♪

08:59.887 --> 09:02.611
♪ There's a pet
who's just like you ♪
♪ 有一只宠物
谁和你一样 ♪

09:02.680 --> 09:06.266
♪ Just like you! ♪
♪ 就像你一样！ ♪

09:06.335 --> 09:07.887
♪ Pets! ♪
♪ 宠物！ ♪

09:07.956 --> 09:09.991
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

09:10.059 --> 09:11.749
Whew!
哇！

09:11.818 --> 09:15.887
Pets and people deserve to eat
side by side.
宠物和人都应该吃饭
并排。

09:15.956 --> 09:17.059
Ahee!
啊嘿！

09:17.128 --> 09:18.266
Yes!
是的！

09:18.335 --> 09:20.715
And a round of patties
for everyone!
还有一圈肉饼
对于每个人！

09:20.784 --> 09:22.370
Not on the house!
不是在房子上！

09:22.439 --> 09:25.577
[cheering]
[欢呼]

09:25.646 --> 09:27.335
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

09:27.404 --> 09:29.508
[indistinct chatter]
[模糊的喋喋不休]

09:33.508 --> 09:35.232
Gosh, mister.
天哪，先生。

09:35.301 --> 09:38.680
You've got more customers
here than I've ever seen!
你有更多的客户
这里比我见过的还要多！

09:38.749 --> 09:40.404
'Course I do!
我当然愿意！

09:40.473 --> 09:42.370
Didn't you hear the song?
你没听到这首歌吗？

09:42.439 --> 09:44.646
♪ Pets are people too ♪
♪ 宠物也是人 ♪

09:44.715 --> 09:47.473
Well if they count as people...
好吧，如果他们也算人的话……

09:47.542 --> 09:49.715
<i>[dramatic music]</i>
<i>[戏剧音乐]</i>

09:49.784 --> 09:52.922
Then they count as fire hazards!
那么它们就被视为火灾隐患！

09:52.991 --> 09:57.197
I'm the fire marshal, and
you're over capacity, Krabs.
我是消防队长
你已经超出容量了，蟹蟹。

09:57.266 --> 09:58.473
Shut her down!
关掉她！

09:58.542 --> 09:59.922
Everyone out!
大家都出去吧！

09:59.991 --> 10:01.025
What?
什么？

10:01.094 --> 10:02.370
Nooo!
不！

10:02.439 --> 10:04.818
[all grumbling]
[大家都在抱怨]

10:07.577 --> 10:09.301
Wait.
Come back, come back!
等待。
回来吧，回来吧！

10:09.370 --> 10:10.439
Me pet profits.
我宠物利润。

10:10.508 --> 10:13.370
I'm ruined.
我毁了。

10:13.439 --> 10:14.853
Hey, uh...
Mr. Krabs?
嘿，呃...
蟹老板？

10:14.922 --> 10:16.646
I was planning
on taking a Krabby Patty
我本来计划
吃蟹肉饼

10:16.715 --> 10:18.266
home to my Gare Bear.
我的加雷熊的家。

10:18.335 --> 10:20.611
You could overcharge me
for it if you want.
你可以多收我的钱
如果你愿意的话。

10:20.680 --> 10:22.784
Eh, huh.
Really?
呃，呵呵。
真的吗？

10:22.853 --> 10:24.818
Thanks, boy-o!
谢谢，小伙子！

10:24.887 --> 10:27.784
You're a good minimum wage employee.
你是一名优秀的最低工资雇员。

10:27.853 --> 10:30.956
Yaaaah!
[crashing]
啊啊啊！
[崩溃]

10:31.025 --> 10:32.749
Ahh, hah.
啊哈。

10:32.818 --> 10:35.094
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

10:35.163 --> 10:37.818
Aaaachoo!
啊啊啊！

10:37.887 --> 10:40.818
Pah, ah!
Urgh!
呸，啊！
呃！

呸，啊！
呃！